"""Small, local-only administration helpers used by the PuddleDuck web UI.

The web server remains the only HTTP-facing component.  This module owns the
filesystem validation and bluetoothctl interaction so broadcast_state.py does
not grow another collection of ad-hoc route helpers.
"""

